		{
			dependencies: ["297417B37473FF96"]
			description: [
				"这个超棒的模组 &aHostile Neural Networks&r (也叫 HNN) &6需要&r制作一个&6Deep Learner&r来训练 &6Data Models&r，然后用 &6Simulation Chamber&r 生成 &6Mob Predictions&r，最后用 &6Loot Fabricator&r 把它们变成 &6物品&r。"
				""
				"This mod allows for &6automating&r mob drops and obtaining &6rare&r resources, such as nether stars or dragon eggs, &6without&r direct combat."
				""
				"你更喜欢 &aHostile Neural Networks&r 还是 &dMystical Agriculture&r？:D"
